# Derived data, not source. Everything here is rebuilt by a script in this
# directory from the feeds under .cache/nflstats/, so committing it would mean
# carrying a stale copy of something regenerable.
#
# The SCRIPTS are committed on purpose. They are the provenance for every lever
# this project shipped or rejected, and README.md cites them by name — the whole
# point of writing down why something was declined is that the code proving it
# is still there to rerun.

# corpus.py — the 2015-2025 player-season corpus
corpus.json

# composites.py — cached play-by-play scan, ~500KB
composites_pbp.json

# fit_model.py — superseded four-driver fit, deliberately not written into src/
projectionModel.four-driver.js

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
